title: CatCrypt
abstract: >-
  CatCrypt-core: machine-checked foundations for game-based cryptographic
  security proofs in Lean 4 — sub-distributions, a stateful-probabilistic
  program monad, probabilistic relational Hoare logic, state-separated
  packages, and proof automation.
type: software
authors:
